  "instructions": [
    "Combine mustard seeds, yellow lentils, red lentils, red onion, and garlic in a large bowl.",
    "Mix well to combine.",
    "Heat water in a saucepan and bring to a boil.",
    "Add the mixture and cook for 20 minutes, or until the lentils are tender.",
    "Transfer to a blender or food processor and blend until smooth.",
    "Transfer the mixture back to the saucepan and add lacquer glaze, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Stir well to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for an additional 5 minutes, or until the glaze has thickened.",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro and serve warm.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
